      "writtenOn": "2026-02-02T23:24:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can those two `if` statements be combined?\n\nIn other words - do we need to special-case `IncompleteInput` here?  Can `MapDecodingResult` translate it as needed?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 340,
        "startChar": 0,
