      "writtenOn": "2026-02-02T23:24:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure how much work it would be, but I wonder if there is an option for splitting this CL into 1) subset support and 2) incremental decoding support.  In general, smaller CL are easier to understand and review.\n\nCan you also please help me understand why subset support is required for this project?  `SkPngRustCodec` doesn\u0027t override `onDimensionsSupported` nor `onGetValidSubset`, so it seems that Chromium/Blink do not depend on this functionality.  Therefore maybe we can/should treat this as a lower priority for now?  On one hand you\u0027ve already implemented it in this CL (and landing probably won\u0027t require much extra effort).  OTOH, supporting subset does introduce some extra complexity - maybe removing this extra complexity (I.e. reducing moving parts) would make it easier to ship the project.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 51,
        "startChar": 64,
        "endLine": 51,
        "endChar": 65
      },
      "revId": "24152c66c06bb44ec97219790b861dfac9193c29",
